# Preserve the exact validated source/vector bytes and their SHA-256 hashes.
# Disable automatic newline conversion, including on Windows checkouts.
* -text
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Keep Vivado reports exactly as emitted, including alignment and blank lines.
*.rpt -whitespace

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
